    - target: {fileID: 4368267274987039755, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Size.y
      value: 3.1167264
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4368267274987039755, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Offset.y
      value: 3.3611524
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7025344861841455819, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcId
      value: florist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: characterName
      value: Florist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: journalInformation
      value: She said the tavern used to serve wine made from the wildflowers
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Those flowers do grow around the observatory. Mostly along the old
        paths, where people aren\u2019t supposed to go anymore."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: The banana slugs are plentiful up there, too. More than they used to
        be, according to some people. They gather beneath the old tree, especially
        after rain. The wildflowers seem to be growing in their trail.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "The old stories say they gather around mysterious places. Old wells.
        Abandoned houses. Places where someone disappeared. I\u2019ve always assumed
        they simply prefer damp ground."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: The flowers are also used in a traditional local wine. An acquired taste.
        Bitter at first, then strangely sweet.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: "The tavern used to serve it. I don\u2019t know who makes it now. I
        only know that someone still comes for the flowers."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: The hill was closed when the observatory went out of service. They said
        the building was unsafe, but the tree was the real concern. An old endangered
        thing, growing near the upper path.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[6]'
      value: The preservation society helped close the area. Or the environmentalist
        society. People used both names. They were very serious about keeping visitors
        away.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents:
    - targetCorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 4359231278659226352, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
      insertIndex: -1
      addedObject: {fileID: 999738691}
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: fa852f8efa7984eaeb899fcc67fdbd93, type: 3}
